# Guard film: turning on the spot both ways, seen from above and from three-quarters (drawn twice a tick, as a fast
# screen shows it between ticks). The legs must step while it turns, and the body must turn smoothly, never in jumps
# (docs/BUGS.md 36, the stutter).
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 30
walker worker_ant 0.5 -60 0.5 -90
log turn
cmd tick freeze
follow 0 1.9 0 0 90
look -8 -60 0.5
burst left_above 30 1
look 0.5 -60 -8
frames 2
follow 0.65 0.55 0.65 135 30
burst right_34 25 1
frames 1
look 8 -60 0.5
follow 0 1.9 0 0 90
burst back_above 30 1
look off
log off
follow off
quit
